                    [ 'h2', 'xTool MetalFab: welding, cutting and cleaning' ],
                    [ 'p', 'The xTool MetalFab is an all-in-one machine: a handheld laser welder that you can expand with a CNC cutting module and a laser cleaning accessory. It comes in 800 W and 1200 W versions. Two cameras and smart nesting make cutting easier, and software with built-in parameters shortens job preparation.' ],
                    [ 'products', $metalfab ],
                    [ 'h2', 'Safety first' ],
                    [ 'p', 'A laser welder is a high-power machine. You need safety glasses rated for the laser’s wavelength, a shielded workstation and good ventilation. The MetalFab has 10 safety features, and a SafetyPro™ bundle is also available.' ],
                    [ 'h2', 'When does it pay off?' ],
